msgstr "图片必须是 PNG、JPEG、WebP 或 GIF，且不超过 {0} KB。"

msgid "Tournament \"{0}\" saved."
msgstr "锦标赛“{0}”已保存。"

msgid "The tournament could not be saved. Please check the fields below."
msgstr "无法保存锦标赛，请检查下方字段。"

msgid "Tournament Catalogue"
msgstr "锦标赛目录"

msgid "read from the Journal"
msgstr "从 Journal 读取"

msgid "typed in the uploader"
msgstr "在上传工具中输入"

msgid "set by hand"
msgstr "手动设置"

msgid "The game's tournaments. Names and ids are filled in by the tournament mapper; the image and the duration are set here."
msgstr "游戏中的锦标赛。名称和 id 由锦标赛映射工具填写；图片和持续时间在此设置。"

msgid "Image"
msgstr "图片"

msgid "Tournament"
msgstr "锦标赛"

msgid "Game id"
msgstr "游戏 id"

msgid "Duration"
msgstr "持续时间"

msgid "Last seen (UTC)"
msgstr "最后出现 (UTC)"

msgid "Name not mapped yet"
msgstr "名称尚未映射"

msgid "{0} day(s)"
msgstr "{0} 天"

msgid "not set (1 day)"
msgstr "未设置（1 天）"

msgid "The catalogue is empty. Run the tournament mapper, or send a tournament with the EventUploader."
msgstr "目录为空。请运行锦标赛映射工具，或用 EventUploader 发送一个锦标赛。"

msgid "Edit Tournament"
msgstr "编辑锦标赛"

msgid "Game id {0}"
msgstr "游戏 id {0}"

msgid "As it appears in the game"
msgstr "与游戏中显示一致"

msgid "Filled in by the tournament mapper. A name changed here is kept: the mapper will not overwrite it."
msgstr "由锦标赛映射工具填写。在此修改的名称会被保留，映射工具不会覆盖它。"

msgid "Duration (days)"
msgstr "持续时间（天）"

msgid "How long the tournament runs. A new event starts this many days before the end the game reports; one day when empty."
msgstr "锦标赛持续的时间。新活动的开始时间为游戏报告的结束时间往前推这么多天；为空时按一天计算。"

msgid "PNG, JPEG, WebP or GIF, up to 1 MB."
msgstr "PNG、JPEG、WebP 或 GIF，最大 1 MB。"

msgid "Remove the image"
msgstr "移除图片"

msgid "Latest events of this tournament"
msgstr "该锦标赛的最近活动"

msgid "Send at least one tournament."
msgstr "请至少发送一个锦标赛。"

msgid "Send at most {0} tournaments at a time."
msgstr "每次最多发送 {0} 个锦标赛。"

msgid "Line {0} is not a tournament."
msgstr "第 {0} 行不是锦标赛。"

msgid "The tournaments were not accepted."
msgstr "锦标赛未被接受。"

msgid "The dates of event #{0} were saved."
msgstr "活动 #{0} 的日期已保存。"

msgid "The dates were not saved: {0}"
msgstr "日期未保存：{0}"

msgid "Lasts {0} day(s) in the catalogue"
msgstr "目录中持续 {0} 天"

msgid "No duration in the catalogue: one day assumed"
msgstr "目录中没有持续时间：按一天计算"

msgid "Edit in the catalogue"
msgstr "在目录中编辑"

msgid "Save dates"
msgstr "保存日期"

msgid "The duration must be a whole number of days."
msgstr "持续时间必须是整数天。"

msgid "The duration must be between {0} and {1} days."
msgstr "持续时间必须在 {0} 到 {1} 天之间。"

msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "监控"

msgid "Running, last run had problems"
msgstr "运行中，上次运行有问题"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "Stuck"
msgstr "卡住"

msgid "Never ran"
msgstr "从未运行"

msgid "Not watched"
msgstr "未监控"

msgid "running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "success"
msgstr "成功"

msgid "partial"
msgstr "部分完成"

msgid "failed"
msgstr "失败"

msgid "cancelled"
msgstr "已取消"

msgid "Chest collector"
msgstr "宝箱收集器"

msgid "Daily maintenance"
msgstr "每日维护"

msgid "Tournament upload"
msgstr "锦标赛上传"

msgid "{0} min"
msgstr "{0} 分钟"

msgid "{0} h {1} min"
msgstr "{0} 小时 {1} 分钟"

msgid "{0} d {1} h"
msgstr "{0} 天 {1} 小时"

msgid "Whether the chest collector, the maintenance, the database backup and the tournament uploads are running"
msgstr "宝箱收集器、维护、数据库备份和锦标赛上传是否正常运行"

msgid "A job is running when it had a good run within its limit. A run that found no chests still counts: this watches the process, not the data."
msgstr "任务在其时限内有一次成功运行即视为正常。没有找到宝箱的运行同样算数：这里监控的是进程，而不是数据。"

msgid "Last good run {0} ago (limit {1})."
msgstr "上次成功运行在 {0} 前（时限 {1}）。"

msgid "No good run on record (limit {0})."
msgstr "没有成功运行的记录（时限 {0}）。"

msgid "Last run: {0} on {1}, started {2} UTC."
msgstr "上次运行：{0}，位于 {1}，开始于 {2} UTC。"

msgid "Limits"
msgstr "时限"

msgid "How long each job may go without a good run before the monitor raises the alarm. Leave room for one missed run: a collector scheduled every hour does well with 180 minutes."
msgstr "每个任务在监控器发出警报前可以多长时间没有成功运行。请为一次错过的运行留出余量：每小时运行一次的收集器设为 180 分钟比较合适。"

msgid "Job"
msgstr "任务"

msgid "Watched"
msgstr "监控中"

msgid "Limit (minutes)"
msgstr "时限（分钟）"

msgid "Save limits"
msgstr "保存时限"

msgid "Recent runs"
msgstr "最近运行"

msgid "The last 50 runs, newest first. History older than {0} days is deleted by the daily maintenance."
msgstr "最近 50 次运行，最新的在前。超过 {0} 天的历史记录会被每日维护删除。"

msgid "No run recorded yet."
msgstr "尚无运行记录。"

msgid "Started (UTC)"
msgstr "开始（UTC）"

msgid "Took"
msgstr "耗时"

msgid "Host"
msgstr "主机"

msgid "{0} s"
msgstr "{0} 秒"

msgid "External monitor"
msgstr "外部监控"

msgid "The alarm has to come from outside the server: if the server goes down, nothing on it can send one. A Google Apps Script reads the address below and e-mails you when a job stops or comes back."
msgstr "警报必须来自服务器之外：服务器宕机时，它上面的任何东西都无法发出警报。Google Apps Script 会读取下面的地址，并在任务停止或恢复时给你发送电子邮件。"

msgid "Address"
msgstr "地址"

msgid "Key, sent in the {0} header:"
msgstr "密钥，通过 {0} 请求头发送："

msgid "No key yet: the address answers 503 until one is created."
msgstr "尚无密钥：在创建密钥之前，该地址返回 503。"

msgid "The key only reads this status. It cannot change anything on the site."
msgstr "该密钥只能读取此状态，无法修改网站上的任何内容。"

msgid "Create a new key"
msgstr "创建新密钥"

msgid "Create key"
msgstr "创建密钥"

msgid "Create a new key? The monitor stops working until you paste the new one in it."
msgstr "创建新密钥？在你把新密钥粘贴进监控器之前，监控器将停止工作。"

msgid "The script, ready to paste into a new project at script.google.com:"
msgstr "脚本，可直接粘贴到 script.google.com 的新项目中："

msgid "A new monitoring key was created. Update it in the monitor: the old one no longer works."
msgstr "已创建新的监控密钥。请在监控器中更新：旧密钥已失效。"

msgid "\"{0}\" was not saved: {1}"
msgstr "“{0}”未保存：{1}"

msgid "Monitoring limits saved."
msgstr "监控时限已保存。"

msgid "No monitoring key is set. Create one under Admin > Monitoring."
msgstr "尚未设置监控密钥。请在 Admin > 监控 中创建。"

msgid "Send the monitoring key in the X-Monitor-Key header."
msgstr "请在 X-Monitor-Key 请求头中发送监控密钥。"

msgid "Between {0} and {1} minutes."
msgstr "介于 {0} 到 {1} 分钟之间。"
